{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration, Adventure, and Mystery in an Open World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to uncover the deepest secrets of nature? <strong>Wild Explorer</strong> invites you into a world of discovery, survival, and mystery. From remote forests to ancient ruins, every corner hides a new story. Prepare your camera, follow the traces of nature, and reveal forgotten secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Realistic Photography Mechanics</strong><br>Capture the rarest animals and historic monuments in the wild, adding them to your explorer\u2019s journal. Improve your observation skills, seize the perfect moment, and complete your discovery book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/0324-_1__2_.gif?t=1745345133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26fa <strong>Manage Time and Survive</strong><br>Time is in your hands! <strong>Rest in your tent</strong> to turn night into day, explore in the darkness, or use daylight to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/0225-_2___1_.gif?t=1745345133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Vast Open World and Map Navigation</strong><br>From treacherous swamps to shadowy forests, abandoned temples to towering peaks\u2026 Each region has its own ecosystem and hidden mysteries! Use the map carefully to avoid losing your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/0324-_1__1_.gif?t=1745345133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Interact with NPCs and Discover Hidden Clues</strong><br>Talk to mysterious characters in the area to learn the locations of lost monuments. Your choices shape your adventure, and every discovery brings you closer to great secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/sa.gif?t=1745345133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Ancient Relics and Forgotten Legends</strong><br>The forest holds more than just nature\u2014<strong>traces of forgotten civilizations</strong> await! The <strong>Legendary Sword</strong>, lost tombs, and tales from the depths of history are waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/extras/0324-_1__3_.gif?t=1745345133\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to become a true explorer?</strong><br>\ud83d\udcf8 Explore, document your findings, and reveal nature\u2019s greatest mysteries!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496690?t=1745345133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/b2e248f2d0f2532f60e36e06a6d2aa5c047766e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745345133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/eb3179ff98ba19db4e4a5d2f12b67d4f7f1b05d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745345133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496690/eb3179ff98ba19db4e4a5d2f12b67d4f7f1b05d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745345133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration, Adventure, and Mystery in an Open World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to uncover the deepest secrets of nature? <strong>Wild Explorer</strong> invites you into a world of discovery, survival, and mystery. From remote forests to anc